{"articleNo":"42360","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=42360&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"학생의료공제회 제도 및 가입안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.03.07","hit":"5327","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t&nbsp;<p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #d8d8ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 20pt\">학생의료공제회 제도 및 가입 안내</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">학생이 질병 또는 부상으로 진료를 받은 경우 적절한 진료비를 보전하고, 학생의 보건 향상을 목적으로 한다. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">★가입여부는 강제가 아닌 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">선택사항 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">입니다.</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 6pt\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 가입 방법</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 가입 대상자 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">○</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"> 2012학년도 대학 신입생, 재입학생, 편입학생&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 2012학년도 대학원 신입생</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">○ 건축학전공(5학년)자 중 의료공제회원</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 의료공제회원 중 학기(8학기)초과자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">나. 가입 기간 : 2012</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">. 3. 5.(월) ~ 2012. 3. 30.(금)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 가입 금액 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 대학 신입생 : 5,000원× 8학기 + 2,000원(가입비)= 42,000원</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 편입학생 및 대학원 신입학생 : 5,000원× 4학기 + 2,000원(가입비)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;= 22,000원</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 재입학생 : 학기당 5,000원 + 2,000원(가입비)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span s